Package: noisedeck-sync
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Noisefactor LLC <support@noisefactor.io>
Homepage: https://sync.noisedeck.app/
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: libssl3t64, libuv1t64, libasound2t64, libjack-jackd2-0, v4l2loopback-dkms, v4l2loopback-utils, python3, gpg, ca-certificates, apt, systemd
Suggests: avahi-daemon, pipewire, wireplumber
Description: Noisedeck Sync user service for video and audio
 Sync receives authenticated browser frames and publishes them to native
 video outputs, including a v4l2loopback virtual camera on Linux. It also
 connects native audio inputs to Noisedeck. Run syncctl pair in a terminal
 before connecting from Noisedeck.
